</p></sec></body><back><fn-group><fn id="Fn1"><label>1</label><p id="Par29">Significant with a false discovery rate of 5%.</p></fn><fn><p><bold>Publisher&#x02019;s note</bold></p><p>Springer Nature remains neutral with regard to jurisdictional claims in published maps and institutional affiliations.</p></fn></fn-group><ack><title>Acknowledgements</title><p>We acknowledge the UAB Clinical Research Unit and Civitan International Neuroimaging Laboratory for their resources and support in data collection. We acknowledge the participants for their contribution to the study.</p></ack><notes notes-type="author-contribution"><title>Author contributions</title><p>Conceptualization, J.Y.; methodology, J.Y. and C.J.; data collection, C.J.; participant recruitment and screening, C.J., and O.H.; formal analysis, C.J.; writing&#x02014;original draft preparation, C.J.; writing&#x02014;review and editing, J.Y. and O.H.; visualization, C.J.; supervision, J.Y.; funding acquisition, J.Y. All authors have read and approved the final manuscript.</p></notes><notes notes-type="funding-information"><title>Funding</title><p>This research was funded by the Department of Defense Gulf War Illness Research Program (W81XWH-19-1-0725).</p></notes><notes notes-type="data-availability"><title>Data availability</title><p>The data presented in this study are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.</p></notes><notes><title>Declarations</title><notes id="FPar1" notes-type="COI-statement"><title>Conflict of interest</title><p id="Par53">The authors declare no conflict of interest.</p></notes><notes id="FPar2"><title>Ethics approval and consent to participate</title><p id="Par54">The study was conducted in accordance with the Declaration of Helsinki, and approved by the Institutional Review Board of the University of Alabama at Birmingham (protocol code IRB-3000004528). Informed consent was obtained from all subjects involved in the study.</p></notes></notes><ref-list id="Bib1"><